38155>>>Object oDashboard is a cWebView
38157>>>
38157>>>    // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -  
38157>>>    // Add a DDO Structure 
38157>>>    //
38157>>>    // There is no need to synchronize a DD structure on the client so we do
38157>>>    // not set the Server property or send ADDOStructure. We will simply use
38157>>>    // DDO's to mine data and generate HTML for our cWebHTMLBox objects.
38157>>>    // It is the HTML in these objects that is sent to the client each time 
38157>>>    // this page is shown.
38157>>>    //
38157>>>    // Also, it is important for the drill-down Navigation interface that we
38157>>>    // do not set the Server property to some DDO because this will affect 
38157>>>    // constraints in the next view that we navigate to.
38157>>>    // - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - 
38157>>>
38157>>>  
38157>>>        
